# Shell scripts must check out with LF everywhere: Windows-side worktree
# checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) otherwise write CRLF, which breaks
# `sh`/`bash` under WSL and Linux CI even though Git Bash tolerates it
# (discovered in ASS-140 — build-web-local.sh failed sourcing lib/common.sh).
*.sh text eol=lf
